        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek AP-86345, Bauhaus Refrigerator Handle</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Bauhaus Appliance Pull has a sleek, modern design that will blend seamlessly into almost any kitchen decor. This Refrigerator Handle is available in several of the most popular finish choices, so you can update your appliances to match your other kitchen cabinet hardware. The Bauhaus Appliance Door Pull can be mounted on any standard appliance panel, be it on the refrigerator, the freezer, or even the dishwasher. Choose from either 12 inch or 18 inch mounting centers. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Emtek Bauhaus Refrigerator Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Pull Mounting: Standard 3/4\" Thick Appliance Panel</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-AP-86345-specifications.pdf?v=1704262357\"><b>Emtek Bauhaus Pull Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>EMT-AP-86345:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 12-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Width: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 1-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Base: 5/8\" x 1\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>EMT-AP-86346:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 18-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Width: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 1-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Base: 5/8\" x 1\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-modern-levers-Finishes.jpg?v=1704354533\" width=\"599\" height=\"111\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
